  <p id="c-nanshi-044-ziqing-attendant:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">之鎮，道中戲部伍為水軍，上聞大怒，殺其<persName id="c-nanshi-044-ziqing-attendant:p001:m0019" ref="yuu_3d9_18r">典簽</persName>。遣宜都王<persName id="c-nanshi-044-ziqing-attendant:p001:m0026" ref="47p_kjh_ez7_F">鏗</persName>代之。<persName id="c-nanshi-044-ziqing-attendant:p001:m0030" ref="kix_r92_2ed_E">子卿</persName>還第，至崩不與相見。</p>
</text>
